 It's Friday, and it's been a big week in AI policy.

 🕯️ Today marks 25 years since the Sept. 11 attacks, a day we remember for the nearly 3,000 people who were killed and the countless lives forever changed.

 🍎🍯 And as Rosh Hashanah begins at sundown tonight, Shanah Tovah to those celebrating.

 Today's newsletter is 1,267 words, a 5-minute read. 

 
 
